  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_hbisc2",
      "name": {
        "en": "Hibiscus the Purifier's Badge",
        "zh": "濯尘芙蓉证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_hbisc2",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Hibiscus the Purifier has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for simultaneous aggression and medical treatment while casting.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Medic Operator during field operations to exercise Incantation Medic responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员濯尘芙蓉擅长在向敌人施术杀伤的同时疗愈友方\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为医疗干员，行使咒愈师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_hbisc2",
      "name": {
        "en": "Crystal Corsage",
        "zh": "结晶胸花",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_hbisc2",
      "description": {
        "en": "'Got all your mail for today here! With everyone discharging soon, there's less than usual, but it'll still be a job to sort it out, Dr. Hibiscus.' A young woman's goods trolley stops by in Medical, where she unhitches a delivery and transfers it piecemeal over to the department's postal desk.\n'No, thank <i>you,</i> really. We're not meant to leave non-staff with odd jobs like this, especially not when you've just recovered from your injuries, and you're still an active Oripathy patient on top.' Hibiscus hands her a small origami floret, then takes in each parcel one by one—this one is bed 6; this letter goes to the old man in bed 13; this giant but feather-light box is for the girl in ICU 5, and inside is probably the doll they mentioned buying her last time...\n'Don't be like that! I can move around on my own two feet now—do you really want me lazing about in bed?' The woman secures her travel jacket, fastidiously fastening the topmost two buttons and nestling the paper flower in her collar. 'I'm a Messenger by trade. All this time aboard waiting to heal has been killing me—you know, Dr. Hibiscus, didn't you say getting up and about would spur my recovery?'\n'You still have to pay attention to your condition, though,' Hibiscus says, shaking the monitoring bracelet on her wrist.\nThe young woman gets the message, and taps at her own monitor, worn in the same place.\n'Will you still be working as a Messenger after your discharge?'\n'Yep. It's what I've been. Heading everywhere and back again, that's my life. A few bumps and scrapes can't do more than put that on hold.'\n'Oripathy's more than a bump and a scrape, you know. Keep your report in mind.'\n'The sun always glows its last, day after day. Life just carries on.'\n......\n'Dr. Hibiscus, I'm going to sign out and discharge after I'm done with this shipment. Do you have anything you want mailed? Now that I'm returning to work, it'd be my honor to have you as my first customer, believe me.'\n'Where's your next stop?'\n'I'm heading back to Vyseheim first—that's where I grew up. You were in the Afterglow organizing treatment for Oripathy patients back then, right?'\nHibiscus plucks her own corsage from her chest—one of Originium, long-inert. The lifeless crystal that composes it is silent and still, now no different from ash, withered branches, dried tears. There was someone who carved this with all their heart into a hibiscus, gleaming with a black luster.\n'Then could you take this flower back with you, if that's alright? Give it back to Vyseheim for me, please.'\nI hope that Vyseheim, and you, can truly make a full recovery.",
        "zh": "“今天的邮件都在这里啦！因为大家都快出院了，所以数量比较少，不过还是得麻烦芙蓉医生帮忙整理一下。”女孩的货运推车停在医疗部，她把货物从推车里拿出来，一件一件摆在医疗部的收件台上。\n“还是得谢谢你，本来我们不应该麻烦不是员工的人来干这些杂活，尤其是你这样刚刚外伤痊愈，但矿石病仍在发展的病人。”芙蓉递给女孩一朵用纸折成的小花，再一件一件地拿起包裹和信件：这一件给六号病床；这一封信给十三号病床的老爷爷；这一个很大却很轻的箱子给五号监护病房的那个小姑娘，里面装的应该就是上一次答应买给她的玩偶……\n“哪里的话！既然我现在能跑能跳了，还要我留在病床上吗？”女孩紧了紧身上的旅行夹克，郑重其事地扣上夹克最上面的两颗扣子，把纸折的小花别在了衣领上，“我的本职就是信使，受伤驻岛这段时间，可把我给憋坏了——芙蓉医生，你不是也让我多活动活动，好帮助恢复吗？”\n“但还是得多加注意病情发展。”芙蓉晃了晃手上的监测环。\n女孩心领神会，敲了敲戴在同样位置的监测环。\n“出院之后，你还要做信使吗？”\n“嗯，我之前就是信使，我觉得东奔西跑才是我的生活。小伤小痛只是插曲罢了。”\n“矿石病可不是小伤小痛，还是要注意报告。”\n“夕照总会来，生活还要继续。”\n……\n“芙蓉医生，送完这批货，我就去登记出院了。你有东西要送吗？我诚挚邀请你成为我复工之后的第一个客户。”\n“你的下一站要去哪？”\n“我要先回维谢海姆去，那里是我的家乡。芙蓉医生，我记得当时夕照区的矿石病人，也是你组织收治的吧？”\n芙蓉从胸口摘下自己的胸花，这一朵源石胸花早已没有活性，组成它的失活晶体如此沉默、安宁，和灰烬、和枯枝、和干枯的眼泪已经没什么区别，但它和灰烬、和枯枝、和干枯的眼泪又截然不同——有人用心地把它雕琢成了一朵芙蓉花，闪耀着黑色的光泽。\n“那就请您，帮我把这朵花带回维谢海姆。请您替我，把这朵花送给维谢海姆吧。”\n我希望，维谢海姆和您，都能够真正地痊愈。",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
